    "created_at": "2018-08-13T10:24:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-13T11:06:41Z",
    "body": "I don't think it's purely just a matter of rendering, different bidirectional text _does_ change the document semantics. An isolation means an additional level of indepedent bidi content, it has semantical effect as quotes.\r\n\r\nFor example, the two sentences mean differently:\r\n\r\nI like \"Red color\". (Red color can be an artwork).\r\n\r\nI like red color. (Here the red color is a color)",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
