    "body": "I just came up with a better example:\r\n\r\nHis reply is short is short.\r\n\r\nThe above sentence can be interpreted two ways:\r\n\r\n\"His reply is short\" is short. (Meaning \"His reply is short\" as a sentence is short)\r\nHis reply is \"short is short\". (Meaning he said short is the fact that cannot be changed)",
