    "created_at": "2019-02-06T03:34:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-02-06T03:34:33Z",
    "body": "> @Zhang-Junzhi Your PR breaks a lot of stuff. I don't think it's correct or helpful. Go read UAX9 top to bottom, then css-writing-modes-3's bidi section. You might also find https://www.w3.org/TR/html-bidi/ helpful, it provides the background for some of the stuff in the CSS and HTML and Unicode specs.\r\n\r\n@fantasai I have read most parts of bidi articles, I don't think I have misunderstood that. I guess you meant it's not a good idea to let the concept of an element's \"directionality\" mix with the concept of embeddness, which can make the the word \"directionality\" itself easily misleading. Then Let me try somewhere else.\r\n\r\n",
